 a mix of mushrooms, tofu, glass noodles, and vegetables like carrots or jicama. Banh bao is a popular street food and is typically eaten as breakfast or a snack."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-banh-bao"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/B%C3%A1nh_bao"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["Vietnamese cuisine","cuisine/vietnamese-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Ingredients","count":5,"links":[["Chicken","ingredient/chicken"],["Chinese sausage","ingredient/chinese-sausage"],["Ground meat","ingredient/ground-meat"],["Mushroom","ingredient/mushroom"],["Onion","ingredient/onion"]]},{"h":"Cook it","rows":[{"name":"Viet World Kitchen","ref":"site/vietworldkitchen-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"vietworldkitchen.com","note":"Andrea Nguyen's blog on Vietnamese cooking, ingredients and technique.","url":"https://vietworldkitchen.com/blog/category/recipes-vietnamese","suggested":true},{"name":"Hungry Huy","ref":"site/hungryhuy-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"hungryhuy.com","note":"Vietnamese-American Huy Vu's recipes for home-style Vietnamese dishes.","url":"https://www.hungryhuy.com/vietnamese/","suggested":true}]},{"h":"More from Vietnamese cuisine","links":[["Alkemē","dish/alkeme"],["Bánh bột lọc","dish/banh-bot-loc"],["Bánh giầy","dish/banh-giay"],["Bánh tráng","dish/banh-trang"],["Chả rươi","dish/cha-ruoi"],["Chả trứng","dish/cha-trung"],["Chạo tôm","dish/chao-tom"],["Coconut candy","dish/coconut-candy"],["Cốm","dish/com"],["Ha VL","dish/ha-vl"],["Hanoi Kitchen","dish/hanoi-kitchen"],["Indochine (restaurant)","dish/indochine-restaurant"],["Khô cá lóc","dish/kho-ca-loc"],["Lee's Sandwiches","dish/lee-s-sandwiches"],["Lúc Lắc Vietnamese Kitchen","dish/luc-lac-vietnamese-kitchen"],["Mắm (restaurant)","dish/mam-restaurant"],["Mắm nêm","dish/mam-nem"],["Mama Đút","dish/mama-ut"],["Matta (restaurant)","dish/matta-restaurant"],["Nước chấm","dish/nuoc-cham"],["Ốc vú nàng","dish/oc-vu-nang"],["Phở Hòa","dish/ph